            </svg>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M8 .5l2.06 5.28 5.69.42-4.38 3.69 1.33 5.61L8 12.5l-4.7 3-1.33-5.61L.5 6.2l5.69-.42L8 .5z"/>
            </svg>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M8 .5l2.06 5.28 5.69.42-4.38 3.69 1.33 5.61L8 12.5l-4.7 3-1.33-5.61L.5 6.2l5.69-.42L8 .5z"/>
            </svg>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M8 .5l2.06 5.28 5.69.42-4.38 3.69 1.33 5.61L8 12.5l-4.7 3-1.33-5.61L.5 6.2l5.69-.42L8 .5z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="review-text">
            “Transparent, honest, and highly reliable. Excellent communication before and after the sale, fast delivery, and equipment arrived exactly as described.”
          </blockquote>
          <div class="review-author">
            <div class="review-avatar">SL</div>
            <div>
              <p class="review-name">Sophie Lindqvist</p>
              <p class="review-role">Verified Buyer</p>
            </div>
            <div class="review-verified">Verified Purchase</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="reviews-nav-btn reviews-next" aria-label="Next reviews">
